					<description><![CDATA[<p>Cardboard Supplement Boxes help nutrition brands pack capsules, powders, gummies, and tablets in neat, steady cartons for retail shelves, e-commerce orders, and subscription refills. Through <strong data-start="226" data-end="285">Shop Cardboard Boxes</strong> you can order Cardboard supplement boxes wholesale in large and small runs, with options for Large cardboard supplement boxes, Paper tube packaging for food, gloss or matte coatings, Spot UV, custom sizes and styles, free design support, fast turnaround times, and high-quality printing to match your full supplement range.</p>
