</li>
<li data-start="10966" data-end="11029">
<p data-start="10968" data-end="11029">Supports tidy storage in cupboards, lockers, and tech rooms</p>
</li>
<li data-start="11030" data-end="11097">
<p data-start="11032" data-end="11097">Makes visual checks quicker when devices are returned or loaned</p>
</li>
<li data-start="11098" data-end="11160">
<p data-start="11100" data-end="11160">Supports labelling systems for classrooms, labs, or venues</p>
</li>
<li data-start="11161" data-end="11228">
